WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:09.606
I guess I am not dreaming.

2
00:00:09.607 --> 00:00:14.689
I am at the airport!

3
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:20.162
Hana: Okay, Bada. Strike a pose and I will take a picture.

4
00:00:20.163 --> 00:00:23.165
Bada: Sure. How is this?

5
00:00:23.166 --> 00:00:26.022
Hana: Good. Say, "Cheese!"

6
00:00:26.023 --> 00:00:31.981
One, two, three!

7
00:00:31.982 --> 00:00:33.949
Mom: We are all set to go.

8
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.819
You'd better say good-bye to Dad now.

9
00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:40.446
Hana: So soon? Oh, Dad.

10
00:00:40.447 --> 00:00:42.917
I will miss you.

11
00:00:42.918 --> 00:00:49.473
Bada: Me too. I will call you every day, Dad.

12
00:00:49.474 --> 00:00:52.499
Dad: Oh, I will miss you guys too.

13
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.718
Call me when you get there.

14
00:00:54.719 --> 00:00:56.112
Mom: We will, honey.

15
00:00:56.113 --> 00:00:58.395
Please take care of Hada.

16
00:00:58.396 --> 00:01:03.074
Dad: Don't worry about him.

17
00:01:03.075 --> 00:01:09.055
Dad: Hana and Bada, listen to your mom and behave yourselves.

18
00:01:09.056 --> 00:01:11.022
Dad: Have a safe trip.

19
00:01:11.023 --> 00:01:14.030
Hana & Bada: Bye, Dad. See you later.

20
00:01:14.031 --> 00:01:20.001
We will miss you.

21
00:01:20.002 --> 00:01:23.585
Bada: Mom, I miss Dad already.

22
00:01:23.586 --> 00:01:28.534
Mom: We will see him soon, Bada.

23
00:01:28.535 --> 00:01:30.778
Who can stop us now?

24
00:01:30.779 --> 00:01:34.986
Here we go!
